# Keep LF in every checkout. The skill and agent checksums in registry/ are computed over LF
# text, and Windows git (core.autocrlf=true) would otherwise check files out with CRLF, so the
# installer would refuse every skill with a checksum mismatch.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
# Third-party file kept byte-for-byte as published upstream (stored with CRLF).
plugins/frontend-web-design/skills/91-i18n-locale-parity-review/references/localize-anything/LICENSE -text
